description = "Independent module S4: decidability and confluence by Knuth-Bendix completion of group presentations, critical-pair analysis, word problem and growth, abelianization by Smith normal form, fundamental groups of 2-complexes, universal covering spaces with deck action and path lifting, and pushout (amalgam) and semidirect-product presentations"
